      "height": 453.5429992675781,
      "rotation": 0,
      "text": "Yunpeng \nSelected Works\n作 品 展 示                               \nMA馬雲鹏"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "width": 396.8500061035156,
      "height": 453.5429992675781,
      "rotation": 0,
      "text": "“复杂”中的“唯一”\n在中国经济高速发展，以及全球化的背景下，催生出独具中国特色的多样性城市形态\n与景观。如何在周边复杂且繁复的建筑形态中，找准建筑定位，打造建筑的独特性，\n提升设计价值，从而寻找建筑的唯一性，成为近期建筑实践中所关注的重点。\nAs a result of China's rapid economic growth and globalization, a variety of urban forms and landscapes with distinctive \nChinese characteristics have evolved. Recent architectural practice has focused on how to situate the suitable architecture, \ncreate its features and characteristics, enhance the design value, and pinpoint the uniqueness of architecture in the face of \nincreasingly complex and sophisticated architectural forms.\n“Uniqueness”  in “Complexity”"
    },
